{"parse": {"title": "锐利尖针", "pageid": 127782, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"锐利尖针\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f8/Item-111102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"锐利尖针\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>锐利尖针</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#111102</div></div><hr /><div>随处可见的针，易引发尖端恐惧症。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">代表疼痛、死亡、破伤风以及不得安息的灵魂。请保证它藏在大人小孩都找不到的地方。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">仓库·<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/481006\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\" title=\"中阶秘物匣子\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\" title=\"中阶秘物匣子\"><img alt=\"中阶秘物匣子\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Item-481001.png/100px-Item-481001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Item-481001.png/150px-Item-481001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Item-481001.png/200px-Item-481001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\" title=\"中阶秘物匣子\">中阶秘物匣子</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">神秘学家都熟悉的小匣子。开启后可从中挑选指定的中阶材料，用于角色的洞悉与共鸣。<span class=\"item-infobox\"><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110102\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B6%B2%E5%8C%96%E6%88%98%E6%A0%97\" title=\"液化战栗\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B6%B2%E5%8C%96%E6%88%98%E6%A0%97\" title=\"液化战栗\"><img alt=\"液化战栗\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Item-110102.png/100px-Item-110102.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Ite